{%- comment -%}
  Outputs the handle of the store product a card stands for when no product is picked in the theme editor:
  the handle in a /products/ link, else the MARCEL product drawn by the pack illustration.
  Cards then show that product's photos, price and link without choosing the product block by block.

  Accepts:
  - art: {String} pack illustration: 'ora-care' | 'ora-shield' | 'smile' | 'device' (optional)
  - url: {String} the card's link (optional)

  Usage:
  {%- capture handle -%}{% render 'mt-product-handle', art: block.settings.art, url: block.settings.link %}{%- endcapture -%}
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  if url contains '/products/'
    echo url | split: '/products/' | last | split: '?' | first | split: '#' | first | split: '/' | first
  else
    case art
      when 'ora-care'
        echo 'marcel-ora-care'
      when 'ora-shield'
        echo 'marcel-ora-shield'
      when 'smile'
        echo 'marcel-smile'
      when 'device'
        echo 'marcel-mo-device'
    endcase
  endif
-%}
